    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d770">

                <pb facs="0730" n="718" xml:id="pg718"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.857/148: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hinkle</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ciudad Trujillo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-03-25T12:00:00-05:00">March 25,
                            1940—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 1:28 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>53. Department’s 31, March 21, 5 p.m. Dominican Foreign Secretary states that he
                    is today telegraphing Dr. Garay his Government’s approval of the drafts and
                    procedure.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hinkle</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
